# Benign k8s-node events: fully inside the redis SBoB, emitted by auditd >= 3.0
# on a Kubernetes node (SYSCALL records carry cgroup=). None of these should
# fire an sbob DRIFT rule (100011/100021/100031); the attribution chain
# (100070 base, 100071 stale-podmap) MAY fire — seed the podmap with the pod
# uid below (scripts/sbob-podmap-refresh.sh emits both spellings) to silence it.
#
